/*
  VehicleStatePanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0287 · VehicleStatePanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleStatePanel` resolves (table "VehicleStatePanel") lives here with its web
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the title + the ten row labels + the state words the web source
  renders (the source hardcodes all but `common.off` as English literals; the native
  port routes every one through the facade so the Swift sources hold no English prose).
  The second group backs the native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / error
  copy). Locale-formatted speed values, the unit symbols (km/h, mph), and the em-dash
  sentinel are SI/scale literals carried in code, not translated strings.
*/

